{"id":"4397ca2cdf99ab61","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-mapping-cone.md","title":"Mapping Cone","display":"df-mapping-cone — Mapping Cone","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-mapping-cone","aliases":["58-df-mapping-cone","Mapping Cone"],"display":"df-mapping-cone — Mapping Cone","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-mapping-cone"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-mapping-cone</span><span>Mapping Cone</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-mapping-cone — Mapping Cone"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"908bc7b079f5d25b\" href=\"?note=908bc7b079f5d25b\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md\">../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,f,C_f\\in V\">\\(X,Y,f,C_f\\in V\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in Y^X\">\\(f\\in Y^X\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=[0,1]\">\\(I=[0,1]\\)</span>。不交并使用固定标记：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z_f=(\\{0\\}\\times Y)\\cup(\\{1\\}\\times(X\\times I))\">\\(Z_f=(\\{0\\}\\times Y)\\cup(\\{1\\}\\times(X\\times I))\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_Y(y)=\\langle0,y\\rangle\">\\(\\iota_Y(y)=\\langle0,y\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_C(x,t)=\\langle1,\\langle x,t\\rangle\\rangle\">\\(\\iota_C(x,t)=\\langle1,\\langle x,t\\rangle\\rangle\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[z]_R=\\{w\\in Z_f:\\langle z,w\\rangle\\in R\\}\">\\([z]_R=\\{w\\in Z_f:\\langle z,w\\rangle\\in R\\}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EquivRel}_S(R,Z_f)\">\\(\\operatorname{EquivRel}_S(R,Z_f)\\)</span> 使用 <code>58-df-equivalence-relation</code>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_f\">\\(R_f\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_f\">\\(q_f\\)</span> 的省略参数为此处固定的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y\">\\(X,Y\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MappingCone}_S(C_f,f,X,Y)\">\\(\\operatorname{MappingCone}_S(C_f,f,X,Y)\\)</span> 保持原四元接口；这里只定义集合商，输入拓扑的商拓扑另由 <code>58-df-cone-topology-data</code> 给出。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nR_f:=\\bigcap\\{R\\subseteq Z_f^2:{}&amp;\\operatorname{EquivRel}_S(R,Z_f)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall x\\in X\\;\\langle\\iota_C(x,0),\\iota_Y(f(x))\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall x,x&#39;\\in X\\;\\langle\\iota_C(x,1),\\iota_C(x&#39;,1)\\rangle\\in R)\\},\\\\\nq_f&amp;:=\\{\\langle z,[z]_{R_f}\\rangle:z\\in Z_f\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mapping\\text{-}cone}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{MappingCone}_S(C_f,f,X,Y)&amp;\\leftrightarrow f\\in Y^X\\land C_f=\\{[z]_{R_f}:z\\in Z_f\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nR_f:=\\bigcap\\{R\\subseteq Z_f^2:{}&amp;\\operatorname{EquivRel}_S(R,Z_f)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall x\\in X\\;\\langle\\iota_C(x,0),\\iota_Y(f(x))\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall x,x&#39;\\in X\\;\\langle\\iota_C(x,1),\\iota_C(x&#39;,1)\\rangle\\in R)\\},\\\\\nq_f&amp;:=\\{\\langle z,[z]_{R_f}\\rangle:z\\in Z_f\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mapping\\text{-}cone}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{MappingCone}_S(C_f,f,X,Y)&amp;\\leftrightarrow f\\in Y^X\\land C_f=\\{[z]_{R_f}:z\\in Z_f\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原式在不交并上使用了未加标记的粘合点；现将两条粘合规则都写入同一个有序对标记模型。商的数学对象与四元调用方式不变。</li>\n<li>未对输入映射擅加连续性：本原子本来只定义集合商。拓扑调用在另一个原子明确携带输入拓扑。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hatcher, Algebraic Topology</li>\n<li>Whitehead, Elements of Homotopy Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"908bc7b079f5d25b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y,f,C_f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in Y^X","display":false},{"tex":"I=[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"Z_f=(\\{0\\}\\times Y)\\cup(\\{1\\}\\times(X\\times I))","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota_Y(y)=\\langle0,y\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota_C(x,t)=\\langle1,\\langle x,t\\rangle\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"[z]_R=\\{w\\in Z_f:\\langle z,w\\rangle\\in R\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EquivRel}_S(R,Z_f)","display":false},{"tex":"R_f","display":false},{"tex":"q_f","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MappingCone}_S(C_f,f,X,Y)","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\nR_f:=\\bigcap\\{R\\subseteq Z_f^2:{}&\\operatorname{EquivRel}_S(R,Z_f)\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall x\\in X\\;\\langle\\iota_C(x,0),\\iota_Y(f(x))\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall x,x'\\in X\\;\\langle\\iota_C(x,1),\\iota_C(x',1)\\rangle\\in R)\\},\\\\\nq_f&:=\\{\\langle z,[z]_{R_f}\\rangle:z\\in Z_f\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}mapping\\text{-}cone}\\vdash\\quad\n\\operatorname{MappingCone}_S(C_f,f,X,Y)&\\leftrightarrow f\\in Y^X\\land C_f=\\{[z]_{R_f}:z\\in Z_f\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1732,"backlinks":[{"id":"d2d4ae7a9b4ff171","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"30aebaf6dc4184af","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MappingCone}_S$ (mapping-cone predicate, see [[58-df-mapping-cone]])"},{"id":"503d015c67c34259","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-815","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-mapping-cone.md|58-df-mapping-cone]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["908bc7b079f5d25b"]}